<title>NEW ZEALAND: Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.05-$7.16.</title>
<headline>Telecom buys back stock at NZ$7.05-$7.16.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telecom Corp of New Zealand Ltd said it had bought back 961,400 shares at between NZ$7.05 and $7.16 per share on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The purchase brings the total number of issued shares in Telecom to 1,805,229,798. This excludes 36,830,592 shares held as Treasury Stock.</p>
<p>The current part of the company's NZ$1.0 billion buyback programme is set to continue until Telecom gives notice it is completed.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
